--
Currently: "expected constant expression, but got
'__atomic_always_lock_free(...)'" followed by "symbol 'pick' is
unknown".  The same builtin folds fine when only read at runtime.
`--64': the expected values are those of the LP64 data model (the 32-bit CI
build otherwise computes ILP32 layouts/types).
